<body>
  <a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to content</a>

  <header>
    <div class="container header-inner" role="banner">
      <div class="logo" aria-hidden="false">
        <span class="logo-mark" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <div>
          <h1 style="font-size:1rem;margin:0">Nexus Synergy</h1>
          <div class="brand-sub">Institutional Intelligence</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.6rem">
        <button class="nav-toggle" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="site-nav" id="navToggle">Menu ▾</button>

        <nav id="site-nav" role="navigation" aria-label="Main navigation">
          <ul>
            <li><a href="#about">About</a></li>
            <li><a href="#services">Services</a></li>
            <li><a href="#ai">AI Products</a></li>
            <li><a href="#framework">NEXUS360™</a></li>
            <li><a href="#contact">Contact</a></li>
          </ul>
        </nav>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main id="main" tabindex="-1">
    <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-heading">
      <div class="container">
        <h2 id="hero-heading">Institutional Intelligence for a Regulated World</h2>
        <p>We help banks, governments, and knowledge institutions design trustworthy digital, data, and AI foundations — securely, ethically, and at scale.</p>
        <a class="cta" href="#contact">Get in touch</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="about" aria-labelledby="about-heading">
      <div class="container">
        <h3 id="about-heading">Who We Are</h3>
        <p>Nexus Synergy is a strategic advisory and AI infrastructure firm working at the intersection of <strong>data governance, regulatory intelligence, and institutional transformation</strong>. We partner with banks, governments and knowledge institutions to design, implement, and operate trustworthy digital and AI foundations — secure, auditable and aligned to regulatory and ethical norms. Our multidisciplinary team combines policy, engineering and operational experience to deliver practical, scalable solutions for high-stakes environments.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="services" class="alt" aria-labelledby="services-heading">
      <div class="container">
        <h3 id="services-heading">Core Services</h3>
        <div class="pillars" role="list">
          <div class="card" role="listitem">
            <strong>Training & Capacity Building</strong>
            <div class="muted">Data Stewardship Academy™, AML/CFT literacy, AI readiness, open data & governance programs.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="card" role="listitem">
            <strong>Regulatory & Compliance Advisory</strong>
            <div class="muted">AML/CFT frameworks, regulatory mapping, audit readiness, risk governance.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="card" role="listitem">
            <strong>Digital & Data Infrastructure</strong>
            <div class="muted">Secure platforms, PID systems, interoperable registries, institutional data architecture.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="card" role="listitem">
            <strong>AI Strategy & Deployment</strong>
            <div class="muted">Responsible AI design, pilot implementation, validation in regulated environments.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="ai" aria-labelledby="ai-heading">
      <div class="container">
        <h3 id="ai-heading">Nexus AI Product Suite</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>RegAI Sentinel™</strong> — AI-powered regulatory intelligence, compliance change detection, obligation mapping.</li>
          <li><strong>TraceAI Ledger™</strong> — Persistent Identifier–based financial traceability, AML analytics, entity graph intelligence.</li>
          <li><strong>NEXUS PID Registry™</strong> — Cross-system identifiers for transactions, documents, entities.</li>
          <li><strong>Insight360 Dashboards™</strong> — Executive-level risk, compliance, and performance visibility.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="framework" class="alt" aria-labelledby="framework-heading">
      <div class="container">
        <h3 id="framework-heading">NEXUS360™ Framework</h3>
        <p>Our proprietary diagnostic and transformation model is structured around four pillars:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Infrastructure</strong> — systems, platforms, data architecture</li>
          <li><strong>Insight</strong> — analytics, AI, decision intelligence</li>
          <li><strong>Integrity</strong> — compliance, ethics, security</li>
          <li><strong>Inclusion</strong> — access, capacity, public value</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="contact" aria-labelledby="contact-heading">
      <div class="container">
        <h3 id="contact-heading">Contact</h3>

        <!-- Contact form: posts to Formspree by default. Replace {your-form-id} -->
        <form id="contactForm" class="form-card" method="POST" action="https://formspree.io/f/{your-form-id}" data-endpoint="https://formspree.io/f/{your-form-id}">
          <input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="Nexus Synergy website enquiry">
          <div class="form-row">
            <div class="form-field">
              <label for="name">Name</label>
              <input id="name" name="name" type="text" placeholder="Full name" />
            </div>
            <div class="form-field">
              <label for="email">Email (required)</label>
              <input id="email" name="email" type="email" placeholder="you@company.com" required />
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="form-field">
            <label for="message">Message (required)</label>
            <textarea id="message" name="message" placeholder="Tell us a little about your needs" required></textarea>
          </div>

          <div class="form-actions">
            <button type="submit" class="button-primary">Send message</button>
            <button type="reset" class="button-ghost">Reset</button>
            <div class="form-status" aria-live="polite"></div>
          </div>
        </form>

        <p style="text-align:center;margin-top:.9rem">
          or email: <a class="contact-mail" href="mailto:contact@nexussynergy.org">contact@nexussynergy.org</a>
        </p>

        <p class="muted" style="text-align:center;margin-top:.6rem">📍 Tunis, Tunisia — Operating internationally</p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <div class="container">
      <p>© 2026 Nexus Synergy</p>
      <p>Trusted Data. Responsible AI. Institutional Impact.</p>
      <p><a href="#about" style="color:#93c5fd">Privacy & Terms</a></p>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script defer src="/assets/script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
